calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, January to February and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025 the middle ran 37% of normal in January to February and 171% in March to April. Grid 19931 had its driest year in 1956 at 46% and came in under 90% in 30 years.</p>"}
